<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow names Corness as non-exec.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow names Corness as non-exec.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building group Taylor Woodrow Plc said on Thursday that Colin Corness, chairman of Glaxo Wellcome Plc, had become a non-executive director.</p>
<p>Corness began his career at Taylor Woodrow Construction in 1954.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
